{"kind":"request","text":"CB-3: card controls stay enabled during a background refresh read (planner ruling 436a613f on finding 1 of 521daf76). The refresh timer's read no longer sets the busy state that disables every control. A press during that read waits for it to end. If the read changed the card, currentGesture fails and the CHANGED_GESTURE notice shows. Otherwise the action runs. A read that the member starts, and every act, keeps the busy state. The Grow routing browser witness gets a case that presses during a refresh.","body":{"conditions":"No press is silently dropped during a background refresh: each one either runs its action on an unchanged card or shows CHANGED_GESTURE; member-started reads and acts still disable controls; a witness case presses during a refresh read; bridge or unit coverage where the DOM port allows; card resources rebuilt.","target_head":"1e251f11d0c350a81b724c7d7a1b84356c16d244","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}